    "description": "Fine stationery under raking light: one heavyweight cotton sheet with deckled edges where type and ornaments are pressed in (debossed with uneven spot ink), raised (blind embossed) or stamped in gold foil that flashes as the light sweeps; a brass die descends, presses with a soft thud and lifts to reveal each impression.",
